        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a326595c-bf01-431a-b8c4-abccadc8a2ad).Image",
        "Description": "SAVE THIS RAVE!!!\r\rI am a DJ in the underground (literally and figuratively) rave scene. We play wholesome songs to bring people joy,  but I found out about a few bad apple drug peddlers at my latest venue. Let&apos;s bring it back to being about music and juice bars. \r\rThere are 2 scum of the earth dealers, so please be their death dealer. Also, 2 seedy bikers packaging drugs (take the cocaine brick, so I can show bible study what to avoid.) And the club owner, he is the worst. Take out that trash.",
